     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi Karl</div><div><br></div><div>I have a large set of BC mapping popution - 7700 markers across 1400 individuals<br></div><div><br></div><div>Even when running 1 permutation I get the following error:<br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#606\">Error</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> calc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">pairprob</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">subset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cross</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> chr </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> thechr</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> stp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> oe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> err</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> mf</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">long</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> vectors </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">argument </span><span style=\"color:#066\">7</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> are </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> supported </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">C</span></div></code></div><br><div>This does not happen when using &quot;mr&quot; method. <br></div><div><br></div><div>Also is there a way I can run the permutations on a GPU to speed things up?</div><div><br></div><div>Thanks,</div><div>Elad<br></div><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "YwX7pGqeAAAJ",
